{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "01df2c5e301dcddf02eeb719e3963c58b8e2231fa2cdd77ebe0f54ac883f18ca", "ja": "魔法世界、再び！", "zh": "重返魔法世界！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "44df971eb95645e33c19d203c1b7706faf75df20d09b26cbc2eda49934d3fd78", "ja": "魔法学園のエリート・千鶴は古代魔法に執心\nするパートナー星梨花の説得に手を焼く。\n一方、ライバル視する可奈が相棒の翼にかか\nりきりで退屈するエレナのため、パートナー\nで魔法オタクの百合子は、一計を案じる。", "zh": "魔法学园的精英千鹤为说服执着于古代魔法的搭档星梨花而伤透脑筋。另一方面，看到视为竞争对手的可奈整天围着搭档翼转而感到无聊的艾蕾娜，为了她，身为搭档且热衷魔法的百合子想出了一个计策。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1000_se", "source_sha256": "a954734ecfe20d4fe4e853429c3aeea062cbe8437b0837f3daabe22c7168732c", "ja": "……バササササッ！", "zh": "……唰啦啦啦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "5b8f4f9e22ad97b66e61ee22cb10e28a732b057bc111a9dcd12825bd2099e6d0", "ja": "ハッ！　この羽音は……パブロ！\nグッジョブですね。その手紙を、こちらに……。", "zh": "哈！这个拍翅膀的声音是……帕布罗！\n干得好（Good job）。把那封信交给我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1002_025roc", "source_sha256": "11005808949f0527b8af9d811a242cefcd9b9ca17ea39e223ce5ed387a015681", "ja": "む、むむ……むむむ……！", "zh": "唔、唔唔……唔唔唔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1003_hato2", "source_sha256": "dfaec127c930800f81d6a6fd2540e966a97d9a4c48aaefbf293c115e9e0be269", "ja": "クルッポウ、クルッポウ！", "zh": "咕咕——，咕咕——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "f3dbc179bb79951786984e556f218428a0048534e875139b942d34d49a08de5b", "ja": "学園長……？　どうなさったんですか～？\n険しい表情をして……。", "zh": "学园长……？您怎么了吗～？\n表情这么严肃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "666e694ee7f2249fc1c874af287898a4601d6fe24b1de3e430017bc677f72e95", "ja": "トモカ……すこし、頼まれてくれますか？\n面倒なオーダーになりますが。", "zh": "朋花……能请你帮个忙吗？\n虽然会是一个麻烦的委托就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "12e1e0aa41c7d5f8ddb70ce4f27ff18727d3b5e57f0884bd6a092ccba106888c", "ja": "ええ、もちろん。私は学園長のパートナーですから。\nそれで、何をすれば良いんですか～？", "zh": "好的，当然可以。因为我是学园长的搭档嘛。\n那么，我该做些什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "413f6b0a17b71e3f93c83e705eb7877c4803eec15e96ea8da22670db6432711a", "ja": "『塔』に行ってください。ただし、他の先生たちには\n気づかれないように……頼みましたよ。", "zh": "去一趟“塔”吧。但是，千万别被其他老师\n发觉了……就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "f147a3e6d8c0c7ffd68c1e5782ace932435a74f5072ba7b4e1b0cf570606e4c0", "ja": "星梨花、待つんだ！　お前……まさか、\nまだ古代魔法の研究をしているのか？", "zh": "星梨花，等一下！你……该不会还在研究古代魔法吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "22d6a347069cc1e0d8c8509738db84f1e01953b532ab30432e25b827ba78bf0d", "ja": "はあ……うるさいなぁ。\n千鶴さん、ついてこないでください。", "zh": "唉……真吵。千鹤小姐，请不要跟着我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "9766e454f51dd66a045060ebdcaa3782bff788b2fc18868c68c4fcc020307ecd", "ja": "古代魔法は危険なんだ。\n私は、お前のパートナーとして責任が……。", "zh": "古代魔法很危险。\n作为你的搭档，我有责任……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "da08e054a364884f0c6951893d26f6467a837dcbf4d56ae5bcbaaf2b006bc83a", "ja": "星梨花、お前この前のケガ、まだ治してないな？\n歌織のところへ行けと言ったのに！", "zh": "星梨花，你之前的伤还没治好吧？我不是说了让你去歌织那里吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "da888aa583b48396eff6716252b34b1bcb81a788187f4b0c63be6c398a5d7231", "ja": "治癒なんて低級魔法を使えと？　冗談じゃない。\n傷なんて、放っておいても治ります。", "zh": "让我使用治愈这种低级魔法？开什么玩笑。伤口这种东西，放着不管也会自己痊愈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "10c01a1c832ba4f8fae02ec67d0db626d966d71dd21cff3b7355457ffaff2bad", "ja": "待て！　話はまだ終わってないぞ星梨花！", "zh": "等等！话还没说完呢，星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "d567f2a80957cc9157cddf70a32cfec57e2106f0828f6baf109947c3c88587c3", "ja": "……。\nはああぁぁぁぁぁ～……。", "zh": "……。\n哈啊啊啊啊啊～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "236eb4be18d7ab13c6e3d968083bd774e875134949e2cdcf33bfe888f21b14bb", "ja": "エレナさん、どうしたんですか？　最近ずっと、\nマンドラゴラの干物みたいになってますけど。", "zh": "艾莉娜，你这是怎么了？最近一直都像晒干的曼德拉草一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "397d524d2d3b4047202c848f782a7bcc65b8ae5593e0dba23aa930eea19fe5c7", "ja": "どうしたも、こうしたも……はあ。\nあれ見てよ～、ユリコ……。", "zh": "还问什么怎么了……唉。你看看那个～，百合子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "594d146979055872af15ec4cb3826258299771867a59551ca0a84fe36797e88d", "ja": "こらっ、翼！　アンタまた授業サボって……\nテストも近いんだから、ちゃんとしなさいよ！", "zh": "喂，翼！你又逃课了……  \n考试也快到了，给我认真一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "22673e0d4e826e8b273be896e14b3c61e64aa8a8843e39a95cdd8bca6f163080", "ja": "大丈夫！　真さんから買ったこの魔法の羽根ペンが\nあれば、自動で答えを書いてくれるもーん♪", "zh": "没问题的！只要有从真前辈那里买来的这支魔法羽毛笔，\n它就会自动帮我写出答案嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "345c864099c842ac2a57fab64130e29f2b41d821d63ebad07e635257ec2ebe97", "ja": "そんなズルはダメよ！　アンタは私のパートナー\nなんだから……こらっ、待ちなさい、翼～～～～！", "zh": "不许耍这种小聪明！你可是我的搭档，\n所以……喂，给我站住，翼～～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "a5adc00421402f6381b507e11c915ae160070ec1739811f2fcdb7fc157ce35a6", "ja": "カナのヤツ、夢想の鯨寮に移ってから、\nず～～～っと、あのニンゲンとばっかり……はぁ。", "zh": "可奈那家伙，自从搬到梦想鲸鱼宿舍之后，就一直只和那个“人类”待在一起……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "0d384c03b16b4a1c043fa123c12c8c3c13d59ba8376eb0af1dd2e5131ea80377", "ja": "ワタシが魔法勝負を挑んでも、今忙しいから後でって、\nそればっかりで……つまんないの。", "zh": "就算我向可奈发起魔法对决，她也总是说现在很忙，之后再说……老是这样，真没意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "dccb9fe3dde439bec29873ee1e7375dec51ad3f0621747182aef796c1c9ce89d", "ja": "なるほど。\nつまり、フラれちゃったんですね？　ふふっ。", "zh": "原来如此。\n也就是说，被拒绝了吧？呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1024_018ele", "source_sha256": "7a63a0a598ea0891a0ec1c78a2ebde5f7817abeb92c6f72e400e0d2d1151f779", "ja": "うるさーい！　……あーあ、どこかに強い相手は\nいないかな？　ワタシと、本気で戦えるような。", "zh": "吵死啦！……唉，有没有什么厉害的对手呢？能和我认真较量的那种。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1025_026yur", "source_sha256": "337a878fbfbebdfebaf6e1af46841302b1da625db0dc205494d1ad04cb924ec3", "ja": "うーん……だったら、千鶴さんとか、星梨花さんは\nどうですか？　よかったら、私がお膳立てしますよ！", "zh": "嗯……那么，千鹤小姐或者星梨花小姐怎么样？要是你愿意，我来帮你安排！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1026_018ele", "source_sha256": "3a734b2bf8444a7667de43665488a7296fcef84814952acce7fec34e3b780f25", "ja": "お膳立てって……どうやって？", "zh": "你说的安排……具体要怎么做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1027_026yur", "source_sha256": "edd16ddd2771ce10a677748511a6e916691f378479debec29472d00130bde439", "ja": "私、エレナさんの魔法が大好きですから♪\n発動するところを一回でも多く、近くで見たいんです！", "zh": "因为我非常喜欢艾莲娜的魔法呀♪\n想多看几次她施展魔法的样子，而且要近距离看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "5a12b572fe06255cf139880030a0f3bc396270a1904f2f1c7f661c53734928ac", "ja": "出た、魔法オタク……。でも、どうするの？\nチヅルってすごいマジメだし、難しくない？", "zh": "来了，魔法宅……不过，要怎么办？千鹤可是非常认真的人，这不是很难吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1029_026yur", "source_sha256": "64ff24216b86f01534dd99da52780053a0e39f3f33b349fd3f2cf8d3c460b2b5", "ja": "そこは任せてください！　私が思うに、星梨花さんは、\n千鶴さんにコンプレックスを持ってると思うんです。", "zh": "那里就交给我吧！我觉得，星梨花小姐对千鹤小姐抱有自卑感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1030_026yur", "source_sha256": "fd41b63872c6a68f9c5a2df0b4b3bf64fedbfeb06c8e512bee90b43dbb2ff51c", "ja": "同じ召喚魔法使いだけど、使い魔の実力は千鶴さんの\nほうが上……いくらでも方法はありますよ♪　ふふっ！", "zh": "虽然同样是召唤魔法使，但千鹤使魔的\n实力更胜一筹……办法要多少有多少哦♪　呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1031_018ele", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1032_052kao", "source_sha256": "449194a438edbcb2225699818e228b1f08b926060dcde17cb9732bd0c6c6584c", "ja": "風花ちゃん、お待たせ！　これ、新しい魔法薬。\nケガをしたら、すぐに使ってね。", "zh": "风花，久等了！这是新的魔法药。\n受伤的话，要马上用哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1033_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d794618a873628516e026f576e5d4ea13d86f944f61a803f1a323ea4d8d0177e", "ja": "ありがとう、歌織。これがあれば怖いものなしよ。\nどんな魔法も……危険な技だって、遠慮なく試せるわ。", "zh": "谢谢你，歌织。有了这个就没什么好怕的了。\n无论是怎样的魔法……哪怕是危险的招式，都能毫不客气地尝试了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1034_052kao", "source_sha256": "5c297525e6d8c695b49d21d1cf7eb70cc758af96e597f46850acff5ffcb18f39", "ja": "あ、でも……あのね、風花ちゃん、その……。\nあんまり危ないのは……。", "zh": "啊，不过……那个，风花，这个……\n太危险的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1035_036kan", "source_sha256": "345c864099c842ac2a57fab64130e29f2b41d821d63ebad07e635257ec2ebe97", "ja": "そんなズルはダメよ！　アンタは私のパートナー\nなんだから……こらっ、待ちなさい、翼～～～～！", "zh": "不许耍这种小聪明！你可是我的搭档，\n所以……喂，给我站住，翼～～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1036_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6d457343e954db1520425319649908f6e6e3b483efd9cefa7a3d692300c118e2", "ja": "っと……この声は、可奈？\nまた翼とケンカかしら。いつも騒がしいわね……。", "zh": "咦……这个声音是可奈？\n又和翼吵架了吗？真是总这么吵吵闹闹的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_01_1037_052kao", "source_sha256": "ef15493c899534b9c94afcb4fd510b946cbc82571bea68d4cb1b0d54fb15b570", "ja": "ふふっ♪　でも、ちょっとだけ羨ましいかも、\nなんて思ったり……。", "zh": "呵呵♪不过，我好像也有点羡慕呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
